{"title":"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/8/d886f432b9f4afecab0e1c86bf001cccf621735b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$W,X,Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3ead47fb9fb4a4c273feee398f72ff2a09702b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z$\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> be four different digits selected from the set\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/8/318bde14ded0257893bbf3b71b1bc4545223fffe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ 1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9\\}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>If the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdda0b2f4019b95047714b7bf78e10ddaf1a0ef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{W}{X} + \\dfrac{Y}{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"63\" height=\"37\" /> is to be as small as possible, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdda0b2f4019b95047714b7bf78e10ddaf1a0ef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{W}{X} + \\dfrac{Y}{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"63\" height=\"37\" /> must equal\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/c/43c9c6b3429f855406f12f07bf8c58c345a7457b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{2}{17} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{3}{17} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{17}{72} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{25}{72} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\dfrac{13}{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"394\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/4/914fbb8336720d6bceff189dfc81868bda5f761e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{W}{X} + \\frac{Y}{Z} = \\frac{WZ+XY}{XZ}\\]\" width=\"176\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Small fractions have small numerators and large denominators. To maximize the denominator, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/7/0472f7201fa1f14fa77217ad79aab047ecfbf399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X=8$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/5/c75397fcf40a8e51d2959e2315fdb409e5dc2642.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z=9$\" width=\"46\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac476641187669bdc5c0780909ff690c015b388f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{9W+8Y}{72}\\]\" width=\"75\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>To minimize the numerator, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27ffdf54dc81864d8e487dfcdcabe8c4aa7e834f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$W=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/4/7446721aec999c7899cd9548409583b375dcdf7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y=2$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b71f5d688316ac9410c0586159d59f4e33942c57.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{9+16}{72} = \\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\rightarrow \\frac{25}{72}}\\]\" width=\"163\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To make the smallest fraction, you need the lowest numerator and the highest denominator. So, take the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and last <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits of the set, which are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d338f393d100febd19e4284537ac40517b48340.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/6/6563c40d9372c5c96a61059f5e50047439386b42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8,9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" />. Balance the equations to be \"even\". Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is smaller than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, put it over <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. You get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/4/df48b76f4e9bb3922b81738f4f26333c8d1a33b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{2}{9}=\\frac{25}{72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>-goldenn\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME\" title=\"1994 AJHSME\">1994 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href